</span>\n<o:p>\n</o:p>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           //几款单品推荐‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍\n          </span>\n</strong>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          巴拿马艾力达 瑰夏 洛玛地块 水洗 - 细腻，经典，花香，绿茶感\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          巴拿马艾力达 瑰夏 洛玛地块 厌氧缓慢干燥日晒 - 很轻柔的发酵，果汁感满满\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          哥伦安蒂奥基亚 拂晓庄园 卡杜拉奇罗索 双重发酵厌氧水洗 LOD#12竞拍批次 - 这款的柑橘和莓果复合在一起特别棒，\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          哥伦比亚考卡 希望庄园波托西农场 希爪 日晒 - 是一只比很多瑰夏都好喝的希爪\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          墨西哥 CoE8 图图塔拉 扎普提塔拉庄园 瑰夏 日晒 - 比上一只墨西哥更为的柔和，核果，莓果，柑橘，果汁感都有\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          危地马拉薇薇特南果 茵赫特庄园 红帕卡马拉 水洗 - 很舒服的莓果小酸甜\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-